  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS- 9706-Support and build a more Sustainable Blue Economy in Aqaba through Marine Spatial Planning (MSP) and effective management of the first marine reserve in the country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aqaba Special Economic Zone Authority lacks a sustainable blue economy (SBE) framework resulting in competing activities adding pressures on vulnerable marine resources. The project shall develop a Marine Spatial Plan within the Aqaba Special Economic Zone for official adoption. It shall act as a tool for conservation, restoration and sustainable management, to build resilience of Jordan&#x2019;s marine ecosystem. This shift from the business as usual approach will support more sustainable investment</narrative>
  </description>
